y are both drawn into the unraveling plans of scheming gods and humans alike, Touko and Koushi struggle to survive.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Gods","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Environmental","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Wilderness","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Class Struggle","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Terrorism","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Monster Boy","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ninja","rank":40,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"The Fire Hunter Season 2","english":"The Fire Hunter Season 2","native":"火狩りの王 第2シーズン","romaji":"Hikari no Ou 2nd Season","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"狩火之王 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"火狩りの王 2"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Hikari no Ou 2"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"The Fire Hunter 2"}]},"trailer":{"id":"YvwgESrieAw","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YvwgESrieAw/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}